      "title": "Second quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.63 (vs ₹0.20 in 2Q 2025)",
      "body": "Second quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.63 (up from ₹0.20 in 2Q 2025). Revenue: ₹262.5m (up 40% from 2Q 2025). Net income: ₹42.3m (up 195% from 2Q 2025). Profit margin: 16% (up from 7.6% in 2Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 16% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 108% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
